// End-to-end E15.7 conformance probe for `compiler.driver.perf_telemetry`,
// `compiler.link.gc_icf`, and `SPEC-76` (`AXS-PERF-001..044`, `REQ-OPT-242..245`,
// `REQ-OPT-251..256`, `REQ-OPT-292..295`, `REQ-OPT-334`, `REQ-OPT-381`, `REQ-OPT-382`).

module main

